<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-RUSSIAN DOBROVOLSKY JOINS DUESSELDORF.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIAN DOBROVOLSKY JOINS DUESSELDORF.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian international Igor Dobrovolsky has joined German first division side Fortuna Duesseldorf, the club said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 29-year-old attacking midfielder has moved to middle-of-the-table Fortuna on loan from Dynamo Moscow until June 1997 for an undisclosed sum.</p>
